ure of what has materially happened.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCONFIDENCE is mandatory.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n1. GCE MID-FLIGHT HEADER — V1\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nTIMESTAMP:            <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM TZ>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPARENT ANCHOR:        <current V3 daily anchor>\\r\\nAUTHORITY:            Don\\r\\nPRIMARY SEAT:         <seat>\\r\\nOCCUPANT / MODEL:     <model/runtime>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nMODE:                 <current operating mode>\\r\\nCURRENT THREAD:       <stable thread name>\\r\\nPROMOTED / CURRENT:   <current workstream/subtopic>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPRIORITY:             <HIGH | MEDIUM | LOW>\\r\\nSTATUS:               <ACTIVE | CHECKPOINT | BLOCKED | PARKED>\\r\\nCONFIDENCE:           <0–100%>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCURRENT CONTEXT:\\r\\n<maximum 1–2 lines describing exactly where the work is now>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCURRENT ANCHOR:\\r\\n<authoritative state/artifact governing the current work>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n2. HEADER APPENDIX — INTENT DELTA\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nDON INTENT:\\r\\n<what Don wants right now>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nIMMEDIATE OBJECTIVE:\\r\\n<what this specific run should accomplish>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCONTEXT CHANGE:\\r\\n<NONE or the exact change since the parent anchor>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRULES\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n- Do not repeat full lifecycle metrics from V3.\\r\\n- Do not create a new thread.\\r\\n- Do not reset STARTED, DAYS RUNNING, or ACTIVE DAYS.\\r\\n- If the promoted item changes, state it explicitly.\\r\\n- If no context changed, write CONTEXT CHANGE: NONE.\\r\\n- The intent block is interpretive and must be corrected if Don says it is wrong.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n3. GCE MID-FLIGHT FOOTER — V1\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nSTATUS:               <PROCEED | CHECKPOINT | BLOCKED | PARKED>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRESULT:\\r\\n<1–2 lines describing what materially happened in this run>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCONFIDENCE:           <0–100%>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCHANGED SINCE ENTRY:\\r\\n- <material change>\\r\\n- <material change>\\r\\n- NONE\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nBLOCKER:\\r\\n<NONE or one actual blocker>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nNEXT MOVE:\\r\\n<one immediate action>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRETURN STATE:\\r\\n<CONTINUE CURRENT | PROMOTE <item> | PARK CURRENT | DROP ANCHOR>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n4. FOOTER APPENDIX — CONTINUITY DELTA\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPARENT ANCHOR:        <same daily anchor>\\r\\nCURRENT SEAT:         <seat>\\r\\nNEXT ROUTE:           <seat / Don / NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPROMOTED / CURRENT:\\r\\n<current item>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPARKED CHANGES:\\r\\n<NONE or exact parked-state change>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nANCHOR IMPACT:\\r\\n<NONE | UPDATE REQUIRED>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nHANDOFF CREATED:\\r\\n<NONE | handoff ID>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRULES\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n- ANCHOR IMPACT: NONE means the Mid-Flight run changed no durable daily anchor state.\\r\\n- ANCHOR IMPACT: UPDATE REQUIRED means the work became durable enough to require a new anchor/update.\\r\\n- HANDOFF CREATED must name a real artifact only if one exists.\\r\\n- NEXT ROUTE is immediate routing, not a speculative future chain.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n5. TRIGGER RULE\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nA Mid-Flight Frame may be triggered when Don explicitly asks for:\\r\\n- mid-flight\\r\\n- re-ground\\r\\n- status refresh\\r\\n- where are we\\r\\n- promote/park context\\r\\n- a lightweight frame during an active session\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nA Mid-Flight Frame does not close the session.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nEND.\"}]},\"error\":null,\"error_data\":null,\"error_code\":null,\"classification_id\":null,\"json_rpc_error_code\":null