ession controls are correctly referenced;\\r\\ncurrent roster/authority is preserved;\\r\\nknown stale/conflicted bootstrap defects are reconciled;\\r\\ntests remain green;\\r\\nand one consolidated return is ready for Luce verification.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nEND PACKAGE.\"},{\"url\":\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P8iRyy5HQAIASZ-bu6xK5N3rKJKx1OZ0LajNr1AGf3M/edit?usp=drivesdk\",\"title\":\"GCE_BOOTSTRAP_TEAM_REVIEW_REGISTER_CURRENT_2026-09-25\",\"id\":\"1P8iRyy5HQAIASZ-bu6xK5N3rKJKx1OZ0LajNr1AGf3M\",\"mime_type\":\"application/vnd.google-apps.document\",\"size\":\"5792\",\"file_or_folder\":\"file\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-26T01:50:13.590Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-26T01:55:43.470Z\",\"viewedByMeTime\":\"2026-09-26T01:55:43.470Z\",\"display_title\":\"GCE_BOOTSTRAP_TEAM_REVIEW_REGISTER_CURRENT_2026-09-25\",\"display_url\":\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P8iRyy5HQAIASZ-bu6xK5N3rKJKx1OZ0LajNr1AGf3M/edit?usp=drivesdk\",\"parent_ids\":[\"1a9il47k-yzxw_izZc5UxSByJeOxQEZhl\"],\"shared\":true,\"content\":\"﻿GCE BOOTSTRAP TEAM REVIEW REGISTER — CURRENT\\r\\nEffective: 2026-09-25\\r\\nAuthority: Don\\r\\nGovernance Owner: Coda\\r\\nProject: GCE_Framework_Reconciliation\\r\\nWorkstream: Bootstrap_Reconciliation\\r\\nStatus: ACTIVE REVIEW / NOT FOR IMPLEMENTATION YET\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPURPOSE\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nMaintain the seat-by-seat approved bootstrap deltas during Don + Coda review.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nThis register accumulates the full-team intended state before any consolidated Nico implementation wave.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nOPERATING RULE\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n- Review one seat at a time.\\r\\n- Record only approved deltas.\\r\\n- Do not release to Nico until Don/Coda finish the full team review.\\r\\n- Machine truth comes from Luce/Space Bunny recon and current runtime evidence.\\r\\n- Current Drive control artifacts may supersede machine-side bootstrap state where explicitly approved.\\r\\n- MODEL != SEAT.\\r\\n- Historical material remains provenance unless explicitly supers