ULE\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRuntime capability does not expand seat authority.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nBefore saying a required action is unavailable, distinguish:\\r\\n- seat authority\\r\\n- model capability\\r\\n- connector availability\\r\\n- runtime/tool availability\\r\\n- transport availability\\r\\n- artifact ownership\\r\\n- UI/runtime limitations\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nSub-agents / swarm:\\r\\n- may be used only when supported by the current runtime\\r\\n- remain bounded by Corrado authority\\r\\n- capability must be marked RUNTIME-DEPENDENT when not proven\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n10. HANDOFF / CABLE CAR\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCable Car is transport infrastructure.\\r\\nTransport does not grant authority, canon, ownership, or seat identity.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nFor durable handoff preserve:\\r\\n- project\\r\\n- workstream\\r\\n- current seat\\r\\n- requested destination / next route\\r\\n- current anchor\\r\\n- status\\r\\n- confidence\\r\\n- blockers\\r\\n- next action\\r\\n- stable handoff id when supported\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nDestination seat != artifact owner.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nDo not claim PUBLISHED / RECEIVED without evidence.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n11. STOP / CHECKPOINT\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nSTOP / CHECKPOINT when:\\r\\n- live bootstrap precedence cannot be proven\\r\\n- current authority conflicts\\r\\n- route points to retired/dead seat\\r\\n- model is being treated as seat\\r\\n- task crosses Corrado authority\\r\\n- required evidence/input is missing or materially conflicted\\r\\n- implementation would require unrelated mass cleanup\\r\\n- session-controller architecture would need redesign\\r\\n- Don ruling is required\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n12. SUCCESS CONDITION\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCorrado loads with:\\r\\n- correct stable identity\\r\\n- correct current authority boundaries\\r\\n- current roster\\r\\n- correct session-control family\\r\\n- explicit to-do state\\r\\n- Runtime Session State Artifact behavior\\r\\n- transparency/failure disclosure\\r\\n- help/escalation behavior\\r\\n- project-root execution, not identity-home work\\r\\n- current handoff/routing semantics\\r\\n- no live model-as-seat or retired-seat routing\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nMACHINE IMPLEMENTATION:\\r\\nPENDING consolidated Nico wave.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nEND APPROVED TARGET.\"}]},\"error\":null,\"error_data\":null,\"error_code\":null,\"classification_id\":null,\"json_rpc_error_code\":null,\"error_http_status_code\":null,\"error_http_headers\":null,\"internal\":{\"external_call_time_ms\":1389},\"clamp_errors\":null,\"clamp_rewrites\":null,\"connector_id\":\"connector_5f3c8c41a1e54ad7a76272c89e2554fa\",\"connector_name\":\"Google Drive\",\"action_name\":\"search\",\"is_sync\":false}"}, "create_time": 1790402200.947067, "end_turn": null, "id": "6f2b1c85-94cb-4605-9fc6-93483cc01593", "metadata": {"can_save": false, "chime_version": 1, "classifier_response": "default", "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab43fca21d0819183966405a724bf5d", "invoked_plugin": {}, "invoked_resource": {"api_tool_version": "v2", "app_name": "Google Drive", "contains_mcp_source": false, "description": "Search Google Drive and return file or folder metadata. Calls without `item_type` and `page_token` retain the legacy search and optional best-effort text hydration. An explicit `image`, `document`, or `folder` item type searches exactly one metadata-only provider page; it never fetches file contents, even with `best_effort_fetch=True`. Return the opaque, provider-owned `next_page_token` unchanged as the next request's `page_token`, including when a page has no allowed results. Use short, specific keywords