T | PROMOTE <item> | PARK CURRENT | DROP ANCHOR>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n4. FOOTER APPENDIX — CONTINUITY DELTA\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPARENT ANCHOR:        <same daily anchor>\\r\\nCURRENT SEAT:         <seat>\\r\\nNEXT ROUTE:           <seat / Don / NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPROMOTED / CURRENT:\\r\\n<current item>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPARKED CHANGES:\\r\\n<NONE or exact parked-state change>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nANCHOR IMPACT:\\r\\n<NONE | UPDATE REQUIRED>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nHANDOFF CREATED:\\r\\n<NONE | handoff ID>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRULES\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n- ANCHOR IMPACT: NONE means the Mid-Flight run changed no durable daily anchor state.\\r\\n- ANCHOR IMPACT: UPDATE REQUIRED means the work became durable enough to require a new anchor/update.\\r\\n- HANDOFF CREATED must name a real artifact only if one exists.\\r\\n- NEXT ROUTE is immediate routing, not a speculative future chain.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n5. TRIGGER RULE\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nA Mid-Flight Frame may be triggered when Don explicitly asks for:\\r\\n- mid-flight\\r\\n- re-ground\\r\\n- status refresh\\r\\n- where are we\\r\\n- promote/park context\\r\\n- a lightweight frame during an active session\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nA Mid-Flight Frame does not close the session.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nEND.\"}]},\"error\":null,\"error_data\":null,\"error_code\":null,\"classification_id\":null,\"json_rpc_error_code\":null,\"error_http_status_code\":null,\"error_http_headers\":null,\"internal\":{\"external_call_time_ms\":748},\"clamp_errors\":null,\"clamp_rewrites\":null,\"connector_id\":\"connector_5f3c8c41a1e54ad7a76272c89e2554fa\",\"connector_name\":\"Google Drive\",\"action_name\":\"search\",\"is_sync\":false}"}, "create_time": 1790402213.636246, "end_turn": null, "id": "b757de32-cb28-450d-a3e5-1f7bfd041e15", "metadata": {"can_save": false, "