JECTS/\n    └── GCE_Stack/\n        └── Rookie_DevPad/\n            ├── 00_CURRENT/\n            │   ├── ROOKIE_ENVIRONMENT_DOCTRINE.md\n            │   ├── ROOKIE_ROSTER_CURRENT.md\n            │   └── ROOKIE_BOOTSTRAP_MANIFEST.md\n            │\n            ├── 01_HANDOFFS/\n            │   ├── Coda/\n            │   ├── Vittorio/\n            │   ├── Chiave/\n            │   ├── Nico/\n            │   ├── Corrado/\n            │   ├── Falcon/\n            │   ├── Talon/\n            │   ├── Keel/\n            │   ├── Luce/\n            │   ├── Magpie/\n            │   ├── Pigeon/\n            │   └── Raven/\n            │\n            ├── 02_WORK/\n            │\n            ├── 03_REGISTRY/\n            │   ├── ROOKIE_IDENTITY_REGISTER.md\n            │   ├── ROOKIE_OCCUPANT_REGISTER.md\n            │   └── ROOKIE_SUPERSESSION_REGISTER.md\n            │\n            ├── 04_DECISIONS/\n            │\n            ├── Identities/\n            │   ├── Coda/\n            │   ├── Vittorio/\n            │   ├── Chiave/\n            │   ├── Nico/\n            │   ├── Corrado/\n            │   ├── Falcon/\n            │   ├── Talon/\n            │   ├── Keel/\n            │   ├── Luce/\n            │   ├── Magpie/\n            │   ├── Pigeon/\n            │   └── Raven/\n            │\n            └── 90_HISTORICAL/\n```\n\nThe `00_CURRENT / 01_HANDOFFS / 02_WORK / 03_REGISTRY / 04_DECISIONS / 90_HISTORICAL` pattern is already reused across the live Drive project structure, so this is copying established doctrine rather than adding another taxonomy. fileciteturn23file0L103-L120\n\n---\n\n## D4 — Rookie identity naming\n\nI agree with Luce's proposed separation:\n\n> **Folder key = canonical seat.**  \n> **Rookie identity = metadata inside the folder.**  \n> **Model occupant = dynamic runtime state.**\n\nSo:\n\n```text\nIdentities/Nico/\n    ROOKIE_IDENTITY.md\n    BOOTSTRAP_ROOKIE.md\n    OCCUPANT_STATE.md\n```\n\nmight contain:\n\n```text\nCanonical seat: Nico\nRook